<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-ST. POELTEN GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ST. POELTEN GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST POELTEN, Austria 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $425,000 St Poelten Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Wolfgang Schranz (Austria) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Jeff Tarrango (U.S.) beat Vincent Spadea (Austria) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Tomas Nydahl (Sweden) beat Markus Hipfl (Austria) 7-6 (7-2) 5-7 7-5</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat 4-Tim Henman (Britain) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>7-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 7-6 (8-6) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Marcelo Filipini (Uruguay) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 7-6 (7-2) 7-5</p>
<p>1-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Sebastien Grosjean (France) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Clemens Trimmel (Austria) beat 6-Jonas Bjoerkman (Sweden) 7-5 3-6 7-5</p>
</text>
